# Git internals, dependencies, builds, coverage, and caches at any depth.
**/.git/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/.vite/
**/.cache/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Dependency lockfiles; package manifests remain available.
**/package-lock.json
**/npm-shrinkwrap.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/bun.lock
**/bun.lockb

# Runtime/historical logs and generated bundle maps.
**/logs/
**/history/
**/transcripts/
**/*.log
**/*.log.*
**/*.map
docs/lab*-steering-log.md

# Generated API clients/docs/builds; keep authored OpenAPI YAML accessible.
**/generated/
**/api-docs/

# Local credentials; retain configuration templates.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
